  "translation": "Mme kgosi ya boela, ya romola mookamedi wa ba le masome a matlhano, wa boraro, le ba le masome a matlhano a gagwe. Mme a tlhatloga, a tsena mookamedi wa boraro wa ba le masome a matlhano, a thubama ka mangoro a gagwe fa pele ga Eliya, a kopa mohumo mo go ene, a mmolelela: Motho wa Elohim, ka kopo, a bo bophelo jwa me le bophelo jwa makgoba a gao a le masome a matlhano bo nna botlhokwa mo dithong tsa gago.",
